  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNW - Syrian Women in the Lead for peace and Reconciliation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Goal of the Project is is that Syrian women&#x2019;s civil society meaningfully participate in and influence peace, reconciliation and any future rebuilding processes for an end to the crisis in Syria and a sustainable peace that integrates Syrian women&#x2019;s perspectives, rights, and needs.</narrative>
  </description>
